start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc 2ch {[3dc 2ch]x3 2dc}@ring ss@top # page: "sc 1" in the ring first, an anchor the pattern does not count
R2: ss@corner 3ch=dc 2ch 2dc@same [3dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 3dc dc@same ss@top
R3: ss@corner 3ch=dc 2ch 2dc@same [7dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 7dc dc@same ss@top
R4: ss@corner 3ch=dc 2ch 2dc@same [11dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 11dc dc@same ss@top
R5: ss@corner 3ch=dc 2ch 2dc@same [15dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 15dc dc@same ss@top
R6: ss@corner 3ch=dc 2ch 2dc@same [19dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 19dc dc@same ss@top
R7: ss@corner 3ch=dc 2ch 2dc@same [23dc {2dc 2ch 2dc}@corner]x3 23dc dc@same ss@top
